    {
      "id": "tang-989",
      "category": "唐诗",
      "title": "出猎",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "李世民",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "content": "楚王云梦泽，汉帝长杨宫。\n岂若因农暇，阅武出轘嵩。\n三驱陈锐卒，七萃列材雄。\n寒野霜氛白，平原烧火红。\n雕戈夏服箭，羽骑绿沈弓。\n怖兽潜幽壑，惊禽散翠空。\n长烟晦落景，灌木振严风。\n所为除民瘼，非是悦林丛。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "65a85b9cd5c5f3694e1f98ed407528337a7010a9628ccfa95374c4fbe31e1ad0",
      "estimatedOutput": 806,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/tang-989--65a85b9cd5c5f3694e1f98ed407528337a7010a9628ccfa95374c4fbe31e1ad0.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "tang-990",
      "category": "唐诗",
      "title": "冬狩",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "李世民",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "content": "烈烈寒风起，惨惨飞云浮。\n霜浓凝广隰，冰厚结清流。\n金鞍移上苑，玉勒骋平畴。\n旌旗四望合，罝罗一面求。\n楚踣争兕殪，秦亡角鹿愁。\n兽忙投密树，鸿惊起砾洲。\n骑敛原尘静，戈回岭日收。\n心非洛汭逸，意在渭滨游。\n禽荒非所乐，抚辔更招忧。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "62c7a13c3df0cd5e1cbf576fe25fcaeb464d260ea10fc5f401a75bd21031ed49",
      "estimatedOutput": 832,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/tang-990--62c7a13c3df0cd5e1cbf576fe25fcaeb464d260ea10fc5f401a75bd21031ed49.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "tang-991",
      "category": "唐诗",
      "title": "春日望海",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "李世民",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "content": "披襟眺沧海，凭轼玩春芳。\n积流横地纪，疎派引天潢。\n仙气凝三岭，和风扇八荒。\n拂潮云布色，穿浪日舒光。\n照岸花分彩，迷云雁断行。\n怀卑运深广，持满守灵长。\n有形非易测，无源讵可量。\n洪涛经变野，翠岛屡成桑。\n之罘思汉帝，碣石想秦皇。\n霓裳非本意，端拱且图王。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "11fa9dc5abf416d9247f89bb2bd5d62b27e59c7ab6f5dde1adc56fa43323e1fc",
      "estimatedOutput": 858,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/tang-991--11fa9dc5abf416d9247f89bb2bd5d62b27e59c7ab6f5dde1adc56fa43323e1fc.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "tang-992",
      "category": "唐诗",
      "title": "临洛水",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "李世民",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "content": "春搜驰骏骨，总辔俯长河。\n霞处流萦锦，风前瀁卷罗。\n水花翻照树，堤兰倒插波。\n岂必汾阴曲，秋云发棹歌。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "e1a4c508f0229065fadb63c8562fbfc201b176575d18a4223a0956acacaa711a",
      "estimatedOutput": 702,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/tang-992--e1a4c508f0229065fadb63c8562fbfc201b176575d18a4223a0956acacaa711a.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "tang-993",
      "category": "唐诗",
      "title": "望终南山",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "李世民",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "content": "重峦俯渭水，碧嶂插遥天。\n出红扶岭日，入翠贮岩烟。\n叠松朝若夜，复岫阙疑全。\n对此恬千虑，无劳访九仙。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "32027268d1a3854feae0a03742e00f96481eda1d7f415ff8473b5a3b360f753e",
      "estimatedOutput": 702,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/tang-993--32027268d1a3854feae0a03742e00f96481eda1d7f415ff8473b5a3b360f753e.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "tang-994",
      "category": "唐诗",
      "title": "元日",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "李世民",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "content": "高轩暧春色，邃阁媚朝光。\n彤庭飞彩斾，翠幌曜明珰。\n恭己临四极，垂衣驭八荒。\n霜戟列丹陛，丝竹韵长廊。\n穆矣熏风茂，康哉帝道昌。\n继文遵后轨，循古鉴前王。\n草秀故春色，梅艳昔年粧。\n巨川思欲济，终以寄舟航。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "87d1bdf40e932038d09ea1025c70f84f97954fb7509357b531eb2080d76b6d65",
      "estimatedOutput": 806,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/tang-994--87d1bdf40e932038d09ea1025c70f84f97954fb7509357b531eb2080d76b6d65.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "tang-995",
      "category": "唐诗",
      "title": "初春登楼即目观作述怀",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "李世民",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "content": "凭轩俯兰阁，眺瞩散灵襟。\n绮峰含翠雾，照日蕊红林。\n镂丹霞锦岫，残素雪斑岑。\n拂浪堤垂柳，娇花鸟续吟。\n连甍岂一拱，众干如千寻。\n明非独材力，终藉栋梁深。\n弥怀矜乐志，更惧戒盈心。\n媿制劳居逸，方规十产金。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "ffa3abb27f3fa8b63a37d00a06e579dea3762f17ab9643920d8ff54521c99d1a",
      "estimatedOutput": 806,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/tang-995--ffa3abb27f3fa8b63a37d00a06e579dea3762f17ab9643920d8ff54521c99d1a.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "tang-996",
      "category": "唐诗",
      "title": "首春",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "李世民",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "content": "寒随穷律变，春逐鸟声开。\n初风飘带柳，晚雪间花梅。\n碧林青旧竹，绿沼翠新苔。\n芝田初雁去，绮树巧鸎来。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "d937911817c998c4f342bcc910b22f91b9e94c08a35a13979bd8978e10376a7d",
      "estimatedOutput": 702,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/tang-996--d937911817c998c4f342bcc910b22f91b9e94c08a35a13979bd8978e10376a7d.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "tang-997",
      "category": "唐诗",
      "title": "初晴落景",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "李世民",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "content": "晚霞聊自怡，初晴弥可喜。\n日晃百花色，风动千林翠。\n池鱼跃不同，园鸟声还异。\n寄言博通者，知予物外志。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "c1fdfe6eed5aa07ab069439cafe250cd106da0611f0801588a0fcb9b91ae6523",
      "estimatedOutput": 702,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/tang-997--c1fdfe6eed5aa07ab069439cafe250cd106da0611f0801588a0fcb9b91ae6523.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "tang-998",
      "category": "唐诗",
      "title": "初夏",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "李世民",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "content": "一朝春夏改，隔夜鸟花迁。\n阴阳深浅叶，晓夕重轻烟。\n哢鸎犹响殿，横丝正网天。\n珮高兰影接，绶细草纹连。\n碧鳞惊櫂侧，玄燕舞檐前。\n何必汾阳处，始复有山泉。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "ced487aacaed022d4d79428c117d8be99117549a5468c5d2919c90879588d50d",
      "estimatedOutput": 754,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/tang-998--ced487aacaed022d4d79428c117d8be99117549a5468c5d2919c90879588d50d.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "tang-999",
      "category": "唐诗",
      "title": "度秋",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "李世民",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "content": "夏律昨留灰，秋箭今移晷。\n峨嵋岫初出，洞庭波渐起。\n桂白发幽岩，菊黄开灞涘。\n运流方可叹，含毫属微理。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "2b3624733cc7085226432981f9d5aa6a66dd128ca329935215fd0518ad149818",
